{"build":"d12e86a@17/11/2026, 16:24:26","data":{"book":{"title":"Kirtan Guide","title_full_short":"Kīrtan Guide 12th Ed","subtitle":"London, Twelfth Edition, 2026","slug":"en","sort_order":1,"shortcuts":[{"icon":"clock","title":"The Daily Programme","slug":"003-programme"}],"audio":{"filter":{"by_title":["Srila B.S. Govinda Dev-Goswami Maharaj","Srila B.R. Sridhar Dev-Goswami Maharaj","Nabadwip temple","Kamal Krishna Prabhu","Manasa Krishna Prabhu"]}},"songsCount":194},"descriptions":[{"title":"Kirtan Guide","title_full_short":"Kīrtan Guide 12th Ed","subtitle":"London, Twelfth Edition, 2026","slug":"en","sort_order":1,"shortcuts":[{"icon":"clock","title":"The Daily Programme","slug":"003-programme"}],"audio":{"filter":{"by_title":["Srila B.S. Govinda Dev-Goswami Maharaj","Srila B.R. Sridhar Dev-Goswami Maharaj","Nabadwip temple","Kamal Krishna Prabhu","Manasa Krishna Prabhu"]}},"songsCount":194},{"title":"Гаудия Гитанджали","subtitle":"Cборник вайшнавских песен и молитв","slug":"ru","sort_order":2,"render":{"tg.contents.first_line":false,"tg.a-z.title.words":3},"songsCount":178},{"title":"Guía de Kīrtan","subtitle":"Edición Detallada. Con traducción palabra por palabra y explicación de estilo","slug":"es","sort_order":3,"songsCount":146},{"title":"Livro de Kirtan","subtitle":"Seva Ashram, Campos do Jordão","slug":"pt","language":"pt-BR","sort_order":4,"songsCount":112},{"title":"Ґаудія Ґітанджалі","subtitle":"Вайшнавський пісенник українскою мовою","slug":"ua","sort_order":6,"language":"uk","render":{"tg.contents.first_line":false,"tg.a-z.title.words":4},"songsCount":71},{"title":"Kirtan Guide","subtitle":"Chiang Mai English Edition, 2022","slug":"en-2022","sort_order":7,"hidden":false,"is_legacy":{"show_micro_thumbnail_on_main":true},"songsCount":166},{"title":"Pocket Kirtan Guide","subtitle":"Nabadwip, 2013","slug":"en-pe","language":"en","sort_order":8,"is_legacy":{"show_micro_thumbnail_on_main":true},"songsCount":80}],"nav":{"255":{"prev":{"path":"/en/chaudda-shiata-sata-shiake-masa-je-phalgun/","title":"Śrī Nimāi Sundar’s Advent"},"next":{"path":"/en/gopinath-ghuchao-samsara-jvala/","title":"Nivedana – Part Two"}}},"song":{"meta":{"page":255,"author":"Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur","first_line":"gopīnāth, mama nivedana śuna"},"title":["Nivedana"],"author":["by Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur"],"subtitle":["Part One"],"verses":[{"number":"1","text":["    gopīnāth, mama nivedana śuna","viṣayī durjana    sadā kāma-rata","    kichhu nāhi mora guṇa"],"translation":["O Gopīnāth, Lord of the gopīs, please hear my submission. I am a wicked materialist, always addicted to worldly desires, and no good qualities do I possess."],"isLong":false},{"number":"2","text":["    gopīnāth, āmāra bharasā tumi","tomāra charaṇe    la-inu śaraṇa","    tomāra kiṅkara āmi"],"translation":["O Gopīnāth, You are my only hope, and therefore I have taken shelter at Your lotus feet. I am now Your eternal servant."],"isLong":false},{"number":"3","text":["    gopīnāth, kemane śodhibe more","nā jāni bhakati    karme jaḍa-mati","    paḍechhi saṁsāra ghore"],"translation":["O Gopīnāth, how will You purify me? I do not know what devotion is, and my materialistic mind is absorbed in fruitive work. I have fallen into this dark and perilous worldly existence."],"isLong":false},{"number":"4","text":["    gopīnāth, sakali tomāra māyā","nāhi mama bala    jñāna sunirmala","    svādhīna nahe e kāyā"],"translation":["O Gopīnāth, everything here is Your illusory energy. I have no strength or transcendental knowledge, and this body of mine is not independent and free from the control of material nature."],"isLong":false},{"number":"5","text":["    gopīnāth, niyata charaṇe sthāna","māge e pāmara    kā̐diyā kā̐diyā","    karahe karuṇā dāna"],"translation":["O Gopīnāth, this sinner, who is weeping and weeping, begs for an eternal place at Your divine feet. Please give him Your mercy."],"isLong":false},{"number":"6","text":["    gopīnāth, tumi ta sakali pāra","durjane tārite    tomāra śakati","    ke āchhe pāpīra āra"],"translation":["O Gopīnāth, You are able to do anything, and therefore You have the power to deliver all sinners. Who is there that is more of a sinner than myself?"],"isLong":false},{"number":"7","text":["    gopīnāth, tumi kṛpā-pārāvāra","jīvera kāraṇe    āsiyā prapañche","    līlā kaile suvistāra"],"translation":["O Gopīnāth, You are the ocean of mercy. Having come into this phenomenal world, You expand Your divine Pastimes for the sake of the fallen souls."],"isLong":false},{"number":"8","text":["    gopīnāth, āmi ki doṣera doṣī","asura sakala    pāila charaṇa","    vinoda thākila vasi’"],"translation":["O Gopīnāth, I am so sinful that although all the demons attained Your lotus feet, Bhakti Vinod has remained in worldly existence."],"isLong":false}],"resources":{"audio":[{"title":"Srila B.S. Govinda Dev-Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/krsnachaitanya-das/37-gopinath-mama-nivedana-suna-4","personSlug":"srila-b-s-govinda-dev-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/gopinath-mama-nivedana-suno","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"}]},"hasWbw":false,"hasVersesText":true,"hasVersesTranslations":true,"hasLongVerses":false,"fullInlineWbw":false},"telegraphUrl":"https://telegra.ph/Nivedana-02-22-6"},"head":{"canonical":"/en/gopinath-mama-nivedana-shiuno/","description":"Nivedana — a Vaiṣṇava song by Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur with lyrics, English translation and word-by-word meaning. From Kirtan Guide.","title":"Nivedana. Part One | Kirtan Site"},"kind":"song","route":{"kind":"item","bookId":"en","slug":"gopinath-mama-nivedana-shiuno"}}